<section class="reviews-section" id="reviews">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-header">
      <div class="section-tag">Loved by 14,800+ Paws</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">Real Stories from Real Pet Parents</h2>
      <p class="section-desc">See why dog moms and dads across the country trust PawPawDoo for their fur-family.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="reviews-summary-card">
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-number" style="color: var(--color-terracotta);">4.9★</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Overall Rating</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-number">14,820+</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Happy Sleeping Paws</div>
      </div>
      <div class="stat-box">
        <div class="stat-number">98.4%</div>
        <div class="stat-label">Would Recommend to a Friend</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="reviews-cards-grid">
      
      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-header">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <span class="verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reviewer-name">Sarah Jenkins</div>
        <div class="dog-tag">🐕 Rescue Golden Mix (62 lbs)</div>
        <p class="review-body">
          "My rescue dog Duke used to pace and pant for hours during thunderstorms. Within 5 minutes of laying in the PawPawDoo Cloud Bed, he sighed and fell into the deepest sleep. The 2-pack was the best purchase we made this year!"
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-header">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <span class="verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reviewer-name">Dr. Marcus Vance, DVM</div>
        <div class="dog-tag">🩺 Veterinarian & Senior Lab Owner</div>
        <p class="review-body">
          "As a practicing vet, I see so many dogs develop premature hip and joint stiffness from thin foam beds. PawPawDoo's high-density orthopedic memory foam provides genuine clinical joint support. Highly recommended."
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="review-card">
        <div class="review-header">
          <div class="stars">★★★★★</div>
          <span class="verified-tag">✓ Verified Buyer</span>
        </div>
        <div class="reviewer-name">Chloe & Dave R.</div>
        <div class="dog-tag">🐾 2 French Bulldogs (24 lbs & 28 lbs)</div>
        <p class="review-body">
          "Both our Frenchies used to fight over our bed. We bought the 2-pack so they each have one in the living room and bedroom. Super easy to unzip and machine wash. Zero dog odor!"
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Reviews Grid",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
